    <briefdescription>
<para>Combined hash + equality functor for fixed-size monomials, plugged into the <computeroutput>std::unordered_set</computeroutput> inside <computeroutput><ref refid="class_monomial_set_fixed_size" kindref="compound">MonomialSetFixedSize</ref></computeroutput>. </para>
    </briefdescription>
    <detaileddescription>
<para>Equality is <computeroutput>std::equal</computeroutput> over <computeroutput><ref refid="class_monomial_hash_and_eq_fixed_size_a33f65ab02e4839b495335487e6fc07b8_1a33f65ab02e4839b495335487e6fc07b8" kindref="member">mMonomialSize</ref></computeroutput> ints; the hash is a <computeroutput>TODO</computeroutput> stub that returns 0 (so the underlying hash set degenerates to a single bucket and falls back on the equality comparator). </para>
    </detaileddescription>
